{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["无穷小比较", "等价无穷小"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "由\n$\\cos\\sqrt{x}-1\\sim-\\dfrac{x}{2}$，\n$\\ln(1+\\sqrt[3]{x})\\sim \\sqrt[3]{x}$，\n$\\sqrt[3]{x+1}-1\\sim\\dfrac{x}{3}$，\n得\n$$\n\\alpha_1\\sim -\\frac{x^2}{2},\\qquad\n\\alpha_2\\sim x^{5/6},\\qquad\n\\alpha_3\\sim \\frac{x}{3}.\n$$\n比较幂次可知从低阶到高阶为 $\\alpha_2,\\alpha_3,\\alpha_1$，故选 B。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["原函数", "分段函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "分段积分得\n$$\nF(x)=\n\\begin{cases}\n(x-1)^2+C_1, & x<1,\\\\\nx(\\ln x-1)+C_2, & x\\ge1.\n\\end{cases}\n$$\n原函数应在分界点连续。令 $x\\to1^-$ 与 $x\\to1^+$，得\n$C_1=C_2-1$。选项 D 恰满足这一连续条件，故为所求。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["反常积分", "敛散性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "令 $u=\\dfrac1x$，则\n$$\n\\int \\frac1{x^2}e^{1/x}\\,dx=-e^{1/x}+C.\n$$\n对于 ①，\n$$\n\\int_{-\\infty}^{0}\\frac1{x^2}e^{1/x}\\,dx\n=\\lim_{R\\to-\\infty,c\\to0^-}\\left[-e^{1/x}\\right]_{R}^{c}=1,\n$$\n收敛。对于 ②，因 $x\\to0^+$ 时 $e^{1/x}\\to+\\infty$，对应原函数趋于 $-\\infty$，故发散。选 B。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["导数图像", "极值", "拐点"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "由 $f'(x)$ 的符号变化判断极值：图中只有两处发生由正到负或由负到正的变化，因此 $f(x)$ 有 2 个极值点。拐点对应 $f'(x)$ 的单调性改变处，包括一处不可导尖点及两处局部极值点，所以共有 3 个拐点。故选 B。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["曲率", "凹凸性", "公切线"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "A", "explanation": "由 $f_i''(x_0)<0$ 知两曲线在该点附近均为凹曲线，所以公切线位于曲线上方，即\n$f_1(x)\\le g(x),\\ f_2(x)\\le g(x)$。又因曲率\n$$\nK=\\frac{|f''(x_0)|}{\\left[1+\\left(f'(x_0)\\right)^2\\right]^{3/2}}\n$$\n且公切意味着 $f_1'(x_0)=f_2'(x_0)$，由 $K_1>K_2$ 得 $|f_1''(x_0)|>|f_2''(x_0)|$，结合二者都小于 0 可知 $f_1$ 向下弯得更厉害，因此在切点附近 $f_1(x)\\le f_2(x)$。故选 A。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二元函数", "偏导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "计算得\n$$\nf_x'=\\frac{e^x(x-y)-e^x}{(x-y)^2},\\qquad\nf_y'=\\frac{e^x}{(x-y)^2}.\n$$\n因而\n$$\nf_x'+f_y'=\\frac{e^x(x-y)}{(x-y)^2}=\\frac{e^x}{x-y}=f.\n$$\n故选 D。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["相似矩阵", "逆矩阵", "转置"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "若 $B=P^{-1}AP$，则\n$$\nB^{\\mathsf T}=P^{\\mathsf T}A^{\\mathsf T}(P^{\\mathsf T})^{-1},\\qquad\nB^{-1}=P^{-1}A^{-1}P,\n$$\n因而 A、B 两项正确。又\n$$\nB+B^{-1}=P^{-1}(A+A^{-1})P,\n$$\n故 D 也正确。对于 $A+A^{\\mathsf T}$ 与 $B+B^{\\mathsf T}$，相似关系一般不保持，故错误项为 C。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["二次型", "惯性指数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "二次型对应对称矩阵\n$$\nA=\\begin{pmatrix}\na&1&1\\\\\n1&a&1\\\\\n1&1&a\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n其特征值为 $a-1,a-1,a+2$。正、负惯性指数分别为 1、2，说明三个特征值中一正两负，于是\n$$\na+2>0,\\qquad a-1<0,\n$$\n即 $-2<a<1$。故选 C。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["斜渐近线", "反三角函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$y=x+\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}$", "explanation": "记 $f(x)=\\dfrac{x^3}{1+x^2}+\\arctan(1+x^2)$。则\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\frac{f(x)}{x}\n=\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\left(\\frac{x^2}{1+x^2}+\\frac{\\arctan(1+x^2)}{x}\\right)=1.\n$$\n再算截距：\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}[f(x)-x]\n=\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\left(-\\frac{x}{1+x^2}+\\arctan(1+x^2)\\right)=\\frac{\\pi}{2}.\n$$\n故斜渐近线为 $y=x+\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分定义", "Riemann和"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\sin1-\\cos1$", "explanation": "原式化为\n$$\n\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\frac{i}{n}\\sin\\frac{i}{n},\n$$\n是函数 $x\\sin x$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上的 Riemann 和，因此极限为\n$$\n\\int_0^1x\\sin x\\,dx\n=\\left[-x\\cos x+\\sin x\\right]_0^1\n=\\sin1-\\cos1.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["一阶线性微分方程", "特解"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$y'-y=2x-x^2$", "explanation": "两个特解之差为 $e^x$，它应满足对应齐次方程\n$$\ny'+p(x)y=0.\n$$\n代入 $y=e^x$ 得 $p(x)=-1$。故原方程可写成\n$$\ny'-y=q(x).\n$$\n再将特解 $y=x^2$ 代入，得\n$$\n2x-x^2=q(x).\n$$\n因而所求方程为 $y'-y=2x-x^2$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["高阶导数", "积分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$5\\cdot 2^{n-1}$", "explanation": "对原式求导得\n$$\nf'(x)=2(x+1)+2f(x).\n$$\n再求导得\n$$\nf''(x)=2+2f'(x),\\qquad f^{(n)}(x)=2f^{(n-1)}(x)\\ (n\\ge3).\n$$\n又由原式知 $f(0)=1$，故\n$$\nf'(0)=2+2f(0)=4,\\qquad f''(0)=2+2f'(0)=10.\n$$\n因而对 $n\\ge2$，\n$$\nf^{(n)}(0)=2^{n-2}f''(0)=10\\cdot2^{n-2}=5\\cdot 2^{n-1}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["相关变化率"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$2\\sqrt{2}\\,v_0$", "explanation": "点 $P=(x,x^3)$，故\n$$\nl=\\sqrt{x^2+x^6}.\n$$\n由链式法则，\n$$\n\\frac{dl}{dt}=\\frac{dl}{dx}\\frac{dx}{dt}\n=\\frac{6x^5+2x}{2\\sqrt{x^2+x^6}}\\,v_0.\n$$\n在 $x=1$ 处，\n$$\n\\frac{dl}{dt}=\\frac{8}{2\\sqrt2}v_0=2\\sqrt2\\,v_0.\n$$", "methods": ["链式法则"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["矩阵等价", "矩阵秩"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "2", "explanation": "矩阵等价当且仅当秩相同。右侧矩阵经初等变换可化为秩为 2 的矩阵，所以左侧矩阵也必须满足秩为 2。令\n$$\nA=\\begin{pmatrix}\na&-1&-1\\\\\n-1&a&-1\\\\\n-1&-1&a\n\\end{pmatrix},\n$$\n则\n$$\n|A|=(a+1)^2(a-2).\n$$\n要使 $r(A)<3$，需 $a=-1$ 或 $a=2$。当 $a=-1$ 时，$r(A)=1$；当 $a=2$ 时，$r(A)=2$，与右侧矩阵秩相同。故 $a=2$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "指数型极限", "泰勒展开"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$e^{1/3}$", "explanation": "设原极限为 $I$。因底数趋于 1，可取对数：\n$$\n\\ln I=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\ln(\\cos2x+2x\\sin x)}{x^4}.\n$$\n先展开\n$$\n\\cos2x=1-2x^2+\\frac{2}{3}x^4+o(x^4),\\qquad\n2x\\sin x=2x^2-\\frac13x^4+o(x^4),\n$$\n所以\n$$\n\\cos2x+2x\\sin x=1+\\frac13x^4+o(x^4).\n$$\n于是\n$$\n\\ln I=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\frac13x^4+o(x^4)}{x^4}=\\frac13,\n$$\n故\n$$\nI=e^{1/3}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分", "含绝对值函数", "最值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$$\nf'(x)=\n\\begin{cases}\n4x^2-2x, & 0<x<1,\\\\\n2, & x=1,\\\\\n2x, & x>1,\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\nf_{\\min}=\\frac14\\ \\text{(在 }x=\\frac12\\text{ 处取得)}.\n$$", "explanation": "分情况去绝对值：\n当 $0<x<1$ 时，\n$$\nf(x)=\\int_0^x(x^2-t^2)\\,dt+\\int_x^1(t^2-x^2)\\,dt\n=\\frac43x^3-x^2+\\frac13,\n$$\n故\n$$\nf'(x)=4x^2-2x.\n$$\n当 $x\\ge1$ 时，\n$$\nf(x)=\\int_0^1(x^2-t^2)\\,dt=x^2-\\frac13,\n$$\n因而 $f'(x)=2x$（且 $f'(1)=2$）。\n对于 $0<x<1$，令 $f'(x)=0$ 得 $x=\\frac12$。比较\n$f\\!\\left(\\frac12\\right)=\\frac14$，以及 $x\\ge1$ 时的函数值均不小于 $\\frac23$，故最小值为 $\\dfrac14$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["隐函数", "多元函数极值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$$\nz_{\\max}=1 \\quad\\text{(在 }(-1,-1)\\text{ 处取得)},\n$$\n无极小值。", "explanation": "设\n$$\nF(x,y,z)=(x^2+y^2)z+\\ln z+2(x+y+1)=0.\n$$\n由隐函数求导公式，在极值点应有 $z_x=z_y=0$。分别对 $x,y$ 求偏导并令 $z_x=z_y=0$，得\n$$\n2xz+2=0,\\qquad 2yz+2=0,\n$$\n即\n$$\nx=y=-\\frac1z.\n$$\n代回原方程得\n$$\n\\frac{2}{z}+\\ln z+2\\left(-\\frac2z+1\\right)=0\n\\Longrightarrow \\ln z-\\frac2z+2=0.\n$$\n易验得 $z=1$ 是解，从而 $x=y=-1$。再由二阶偏导计算可得在该点\n$$\nz_{xx}=z_{yy}=-\\frac23,\\qquad z_{xy}=0,\n$$\nHessian 负定，所以此点为极大点，极大值为 1。方程不存在更小的局部极值点，故无极小值。", "methods": ["隐函数求导", "求导公式"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二重积分", "极坐标"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$1-\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}$", "explanation": "区域 $D$ 为顶角在原点、上边界为 $y=1$ 的等腰三角形。改用极坐标\n$$\nx=r\\cos\\theta,\\qquad y=r\\sin\\theta,\n$$\n则\n$$\n\\frac{x^2-xy-y^2}{x^2+y^2}\n=\\cos^2\\theta-\\cos\\theta\\sin\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta.\n$$\n区域对应\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\le\\theta\\le\\frac{3\\pi}{4},\\qquad 0\\le r\\le \\frac1{\\sin\\theta}.\n$$\n因此\n$$\n\\iint_D \\frac{x^2-xy-y^2}{x^2+y^2}\\,dx\\,dy\n=\\int_{\\pi/4}^{3\\pi/4}\\int_0^{1/\\sin\\theta}\n(\\cos^2\\theta-\\cos\\theta\\sin\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta)\\,r\\,dr\\,d\\theta\n=1-\\frac{\\pi}{2}.\n$$", "methods": ["极坐标变换"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q019", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 19, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二阶线性微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q019.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$$\nu(x)=-(2x+1)e^{-x},\n\\qquad\ny=C_1e^x+C_2(2x+1).\n$$", "explanation": "令 $y=u(x)e^x$ 代入原方程。利用已知解 $e^x$ 进行降阶，可化为关于 $v=u'$ 的一阶方程\n$$\n(2x-1)v'+(2x-3)v=0.\n$$\n解得\n$$\nv=u'=C(2x-1)e^{-x}.\n$$\n积分可得\n$$\nu(x)=A(-(2x+1)e^{-x})+B.\n$$\n代入条件 $u(-1)=e,\\ u(0)=-1$，解得 $A=1,\\ B=0$，故\n$$\nu(x)=-(2x+1)e^{-x}.\n$$\n于是\n$$\ny_2(x)=u(x)e^x=-(2x+1),\n$$\n与 $e^x$ 线性无关，所以通解为\n$$\ny=C_1e^x+C_2(2x+1).\n$$", "methods": ["降阶法"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q020", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 20, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["旋转体", "体积", "曲面面积"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q020.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$$\nV=\\frac{18\\pi}{35},\\qquad S=\\frac{16\\pi}{5}.\n$$", "explanation": "外边界为四分之一单位圆 $y=\\sqrt{1-x^2}$，内边界为星形线第一象限弧\n$x^{2/3}+y^{2/3}=1$。体积由垫片法得\n$$\nV=\\pi\\int_0^1\\left[(1-x^2)-\\left(1-x^{2/3}\\right)^3\\right]dx\n=\\frac{18\\pi}{35}.\n$$\n表面积等于两条母线旋转所得面积之和。圆弧部分\n$$\nS_1=2\\pi\\int_0^1 y\\sqrt{1+(y')^2}\\,dx=2\\pi.\n$$\n星形线用参数方程计算：\n$$\nx=\\cos^3 t,\\quad y=\\sin^3 t,\\quad\nds=\\sqrt{\\left(\\frac{dx}{dt}\\right)^2+\\left(\\frac{dy}{dt}\\right)^2}\\,dt\n=3\\sin t\\cos t\\,dt.\n$$\n故\n$$\nS_2=2\\pi\\int_0^{\\pi/2} y\\,ds\n=2\\pi\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^3 t\\cdot 3\\sin t\\cos t\\,dt\n=\\frac{6\\pi}{5}.\n$$\n因此\n$$\nS=S_1+S_2=2\\pi+\\frac{6\\pi}{5}=\\frac{16\\pi}{5}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q021", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 21, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["原函数", "平均值", "零点唯一性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q021.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "(I) 平均值为\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3\\pi}.\n$$\n(II) $f(x)$ 在 $\\left(0,\\dfrac{3\\pi}{2}\\right)$ 内恰有一个零点。", "explanation": "设\n$$\na=\\frac{3\\pi}{2}.\n$$\n由分部积分，\n$$\n\\int_0^a f(x)\\,dx=[xf(x)]_0^a-\\int_0^a x f'(x)\\,dx.\n$$\n又\n$$\nf'(x)=\\frac{\\cos x}{2x-3\\pi},\n\\qquad\nx=\\frac12(2x-3\\pi)+\\frac{3\\pi}{2},\n$$\n从而\n$$\n\\int_0^a x f'(x)\\,dx\n=\\frac12\\int_0^a \\cos x\\,dx+\\frac{3\\pi}{2}\\int_0^a f'(x)\\,dx\n=-\\frac12+\\frac{3\\pi}{2}(f(a)-f(0)).\n$$\n代回后消去 $f(a)$，得\n$$\n\\int_0^a f(x)\\,dx=\\frac12,\n$$\n所以平均值为\n$$\n\\frac{1}{a}\\cdot\\frac12=\\frac1{3\\pi}.\n$$\n\n对于唯一性，注意到\n$$\nf'(x)=\\frac{\\cos x}{2x-3\\pi}.\n$$\n在 $\\left(0,\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$ 上，$\\cos x>0$ 且分母 $<0$，故 $f'(x)<0$；在 $\\left(\\dfrac{\\pi}{2},\\dfrac{3\\pi}{2}\\right)$ 上，$\\cos x<0$ 且分母仍 $<0$，故 $f'(x)>0$。因此 $f$ 先减后增。\n又 $f(0)=0$，且平均值为正，所以函数在后半段必须升回到正值，因而至少有一个零点。由于其单调性仅改变一次，故零点只能有一个，遂知在 $\\left(0,\\dfrac{3\\pi}{2}\\right)$ 内恰有一个零点。", "methods": ["分部积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q022", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 22, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["线性方程组", "无解条件", "法方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q022.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "(I) $a=0$；\n\n(II)\n$$\nx=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1\\\\\n-2\\\\\n0\n\\end{pmatrix}\n+t\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n0\\\\\n-1\\\\\n1\n\\end{pmatrix},\n\\qquad t\\in\\mathbb{R}.\n$$", "explanation": "要使 $Ax=\\beta$ 无解，必须有\n$$\nr(A)<r(A,\\beta).\n$$\n先算\n$$\n\\det A=a(a-2).\n$$\n当 $a=2$ 时，直接验算增广矩阵秩仍为 2，方程有解；当 $a=0$ 时，$r(A)=2,\\ r(A,\\beta)=3$，故恰无解，因此 $a=0$。\n\n取 $a=0$ 后，\n$$\nA=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&1&1\\\\\n1&0&0\\\\\n1&1&1\n\\end{pmatrix},\n\\qquad\n\\beta=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n0\\\\\n1\\\\\n-2\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n法方程\n$A^{\\mathsf T}Ax=A^{\\mathsf T}\\beta$\n的解集等于最小二乘解集。求解可得一个特解\n$$\nx_0=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-2\\\\0\\end{pmatrix},\n$$\n齐次方程 $Ax=0$ 的基础解系可取\n$$\n\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\-1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n因此通解为\n$$\nx=x_0+t\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\-1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad t\\in\\mathbb R.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016_q023", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2016", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2016, "question_number": 23, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["矩阵幂", "矩阵递推", "列向量表示"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q023.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "$$\nA^{99}=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n2^{99}-2 & -(2^{99}-1) & -(2^{98}-2)\\\\\n2^{100}-2 & -(2^{100}-1) & -(2^{99}-2)\\\\\n0&0&0\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n\n因而\n$$\n\\beta_1=(2^{99}-2)\\alpha_1+(2^{100}-2)\\alpha_2,\n$$\n$$\n\\beta_2=-(2^{99}-1)\\alpha_1-(2^{100}-1)\\alpha_2,\n$$\n$$\n\\beta_3=-(2^{98}-2)\\alpha_1-(2^{99}-2)\\alpha_2.\n$$", "explanation": "由直接乘法可归纳得到\n$$\nA^n=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n(-1)^{n-1}(2^n-2) & (-1)^n(2^n-1) & (-1)^n(2^{n-1}-2)\\\\\n(-1)^{n-1}(2^{n+1}-2) & (-1)^n(2^{n+1}-1) & (-1)^n(2^n-2)\\\\\n0&0&0\n\\end{pmatrix}\\quad(n\\ge1).\n$$\n取 $n=99$ 即得\n$$\nA^{99}=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n2^{99}-2 & -(2^{99}-1) & -(2^{98}-2)\\\\\n2^{100}-2 & -(2^{100}-1) & -(2^{99}-2)\\\\\n0&0&0\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n\n又由 $B^2=BA$，可归纳得\n$$\nB^n=BA^{n-1}\\qquad(n\\ge2).\n$$\n因此\n$$\nB^{100}=BA^{99}.\n$$\n因 $B=(\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\alpha_3)$，右乘矩阵时各列恰对应 $\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\alpha_3$ 的线性组合，所以 $B^{100}$ 的三列正是 $A^{99}$ 三列作为系数得到的组合。第三行全为 0，故三列都不含 $\\alpha_3$ 项，结果如上。", "methods": []}
